{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207320","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207320","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1720732001:1":{"text":"デューラ様……ん？あなたたちは……","source_cn":"艾雅在上，几位是……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED985422F382F341","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1720732002:1":{"text":"この子たちを連れてきたの。家もなくて、チンピラに利用されてるところを私たちが助けたんだけど……この教会で預かってもらうことはできる？","source_cn":"我们在街上遇到了这几个孩子，他们无家可归，还被坏人欺负...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C06A0C44337B154","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720732003:1":{"text":"それはそれは、可哀想に……","source_cn":"这……唉，可怜的孩子们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x567FA57A2EF33BFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720732004:1":{"text":"ですが……最近、この子たちのような行き場のない子どもたちが増えていて、もう教会だけでは手に負える状況じゃないんです……","source_cn":"最近流浪的孩子越来越多了，已经到了教堂的人手远远不够照...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x847C7A2C2E312553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720732005:1":{"text":"そ、そんな……まさか教会まで……","source_cn":"这、怎么会这样……连教堂也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD5546B2FA4E6B5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720732006:1":{"text":"すみません……女神に仕える者として、本来なら救いを求める魂を拒むなどあってはならないのですが……","source_cn":"抱歉，作为女神的仆人，我不该拒绝任何一个求助的灵魂。我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1443066C2563A7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720732007:1":{"text":"私はただ、この子たちに十分なケアをしてあげられるか心配で……","source_cn":"我只是担心孩子们留在教堂里，不能得到足够好的照顾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEFFE3150520E3D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1720732007":{"text":"私はただ、この子たちに十分なケアをしてあげられるか心配で……","source_cn":"我只是担心孩子们留在教堂里，不能得到足够好的照顾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEFFE3150520E3D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720732008:4":{"text":"お姉さん……わたしたちご飯もそんなにいらないし、お手伝いもするから……","source_cn":"姐姐……我们吃得很少的，也会干活……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5E1C25C636ED322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720732009:0":{"text":"うぅぅ……また町をさまようなんてイヤだ……","source_cn":"呜呜，我不想再流浪了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6463B5753265DEC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720732